      "message": "test(post): Tormach probe goldens take #570's safe-plane descent\n\n#583's Tormach probe goldens were written against the probe cycle before\n#570 (#579), and the two merged two minutes apart, so probe_tormach failed\n6/7 on main. The regenerated goldens rapid only to the safe plane\n(Z 50 mm = 1.9685 in) and descend from there with a protected G38.3 feed,\nwhere the stale ones rapided straight to Z 25 mm over the part. No\nrapid below the safe plane remains in any of them; the o-word numbers\nshift by the one added guard.\n\nFixes #695\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
